  id: 97
  missionName: FATHER AND SON
  missionType: CONVERSATION
  briefing: The chamber at the summit. Kagehira is waiting inside it, unhurried,
    with Aiko beside him and the three keys in the lock. He wants to talk before
    the end.
  debrief: '''Your father chose the villages. I chose the future. One of us was right,
    boy. Let us find out which.'''
